# Project TITAN V1.1 — Workflow (QMS + Smart Factory Lite)

> **Primary:** `.cursor/rules/project-titan-official-architecture.mdc` · `docs/TITAN_OFFICIAL_ARCHITECTURE.md`

**Smart Access:** `.cursor/rules/project-titan-smart-access-architecture.mdc` · `docs/SMART_ACCESS_ARCHITECTURE.md`

## Principles

- **One Time Input → One Scan → One Workflow**
- **Not a design change** — reuse existing screens (작업일보, 입고, 출고, 검사).
- **Paper Workflow must not be removed** — HTL/OUT/INV/DPR prints stay.
- **Smart Workflow is additive** — Smart Access ID → existing screens via `SMART_ACCESS_TARGETS`.
- **NFC = same Smart Access ID as QR** — no separate handler.
- **Product Master** — `products.process` / `record.heatTreatment` drives process filter.
- **Do not replace MES** — MES Ready · Repository swap only · UI unchanged.

## Paper Mode (fixed)

입고 → 입고리스트(DOC-01) → 생산 → 검사 → 성적서 → 출고 → 통계

## Smart Mode (full chain)

QR/NFC → 설비/위치 인식 → 공정 확인 → 생산 가능 목록 → LOT → 생산중 → 생산완료 → 검사대기 → **검사 → 성적서 → 출고**

## Code SSoT

- `src/config/titanOfficialArchitecture.js` — PAPER_WORKFLOW_CHAIN · SMART_WORKFLOW_CHAIN
- `src/config/smartAccessArchitecture.js` — Route Registry · Smart Access ID
- `src/config/titanV11Workflow.js` — re-exports + producible sources
- `src/utils/equipmentQr.js` — `NDK://EQ/{code}` + `NDK|EQ|{code}`
- `src/utils/smartProducibleWorkList.js`
- `src/utils/titanWorkflowStatus.js` — status machine (do not duplicate)

## Smart Entry URL

```
/production/daily-report?equipment=ION-01
/production/daily-report?qr=NDK://EQ/ION-01
/production/daily-report?qr=NDK|EQ|ION-01   (legacy)
```

## Do Not

- Remove print buttons or paper flows
- Create separate mobile UI (QR → browser URL until field mode approved)
- Change approved list layouts for Smart features — panel only inside 작업일보
